'''Mega Gengar ex''' (Japanese: '''メガゲンガーex''' ''Mega Gangar ex'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Stage 2 {{TCGP|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Shine}} expansion.

